  Layer template for New Project -> Kotlin -> Kotlin Script.

  The file content is not used: KotlinProjectWizardIterator generates the project skeleton
  with the IDEA Kotlin New Project Wizard, adds `src/main/kotlin/main.kts`, and returns the
  generated project directory. The layer entry only needs a real file to attach the template
  attributes to.
-->
